#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Health check"
msgstr "健康檢查"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Run a read-only health check of this system: resources, disk usage, failed services, recent errors in the journal, and pending updates. Summarize problems by severity."
msgstr "對這台系統做唯讀健康檢查：資源、磁碟用量、失敗的服務、日誌中的近期錯誤，以及待安裝的更新。依嚴重程度整理問題。"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Why is it slow?"
msgstr "為什麼變慢？"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "The system feels slow. Investigate CPU, memory, swap, disk usage and the top processes, and explain the most likely cause."
msgstr "系統感覺變慢了。請檢查 CPU、記憶體、swap、磁碟用量和最耗資源的程序，並說明最可能的原因。"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Failed services"
msgstr "失敗的服務"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "List failed systemd units, show the relevant journal errors for each, and suggest fixes without changing anything yet."
msgstr "列出失敗的 systemd unit，顯示各自相關的日誌錯誤，並提出修正建議，先不要做任何變更。"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Available updates"
msgstr "可用更新"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Check for available package updates and whether a reboot is required. Do not install anything."
msgstr "檢查可用的套件更新以及是否需要重新開機。不要安裝任何東西。"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Security review"
msgstr "安全檢查"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Do a read-only security review: listening ports, firewall status, SELinux/AppArmor, failed SSH logins and recent logins. Highlight anything unusual."
msgstr "做一次唯讀安全檢查：監聽埠、防火牆狀態、SELinux/AppArmor、SSH 登入失敗和近期登入紀錄。標出任何異常。"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Allow for this chat"
msgstr "本次對話都允許"

#: src/components/ChatPanel.tsx
msgid "Continue"
msgstr "繼續"

#: src/components/SettingsPage.tsx
msgid "Maximum tool steps per request"
msgstr "每次請求的最大工具步數"

#: src/components/SettingsPage.tsx
msgid "When reached, the agent pauses and can be continued."
msgstr "達到上限時代理會暫停，之後可以繼續。"

